<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 350.75mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 350.75mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 350.75 million dirhams ($37.1 million) from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    Five years    300.75	  100		     9.5 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	250.75	  250.75		 10.50 pct</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	   551.50	  350.75</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for March 17, 1997.</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518. ($ = 9.464 Moroccan Dirhams)</p>
</text>
